  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FDW Programme Communications and Knowledge Dissemination</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment supports the communication and knowledge dissemination of the Sustainable Water Fund (FDW) programme by developing a series of English-language publications that highlight experiences, results and lessons from public&#x2013;private partnership (PPP) water projects in developing countries. The activity aims to share insights from the FDW portfolio with policymakers, practitioners and donors, inspire new partnerships, and strengthen the visibility and impact of the programme in contributing to water security and the Sustainable Development Goals.</narrative>
  </description>
